---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import AboutCarousel from "../components/AboutCarousel";
---

<Layout title="About - Sam Masto">
  <div class="p-8 flex flex-col text-white">
    <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold font-heading">About Me</h1>
    <div class="flex flex-col-reverse md:flex-row">
      <div class="w-full md:w-2/3 pr-5">
        <p class="mt-4 text-2xl">
          Sam Masto is your quintessential triple threat (actor, singer,
          computer scientist). Originally from San Francisco, he studied at
          Brown University where he split his time between Theater and
          Computer Science. In 2021, he was awarded the MH Hicks Award for
          outstanding work in Brown's Theater Arts and Performance Studies
          department.
          <br /><br />
          After graduating, he moved to LA with the goal of wearing a t-shirt in
          January. Since then, he's performed in a variety of award-winning short
          films (Work Life, Apologized), the 2024 Feature Film "Gnome Sick: 7 Slays
          Till Mithras", theatrical productions (Cannibal: The Musical, Space Captain:
          Captain of Space), and various improv and sketch shows.
          <br /><br />
          He's currently working through the Groundlings lab track and he additionally
          trains at UCB. He is commercially represented by AKA Talent Agency. In
          his free time, you can find him head-banging at a concert, running a D&amp;D
          session, or maybe singing about drinking pi&ntilde;a coladas in the rain.
        </p>
      </div>
      <AboutCarousel client:load />
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
